01:05:04,625 --> 01:05:06,958
-Ini dia.
-Apa?

1186
01:05:07,041 --> 01:05:09,208
-Ini.
-Astaga. Terima kasih.

1187
01:05:18,041 --> 01:05:19,333
Astaga.

1188
