1314
01:11:14,541 --> 01:11:17,708
Aku tak mau lihat buaya
teler karena kokaina Brasil.

1315
01:11:17,791 --> 01:11:19,333
Kurasa itu aligator.

1316
01:11:19,416 --> 01:11:21,750
