1318
01:11:35,541 --> 01:11:37,500
Apa dia mati?

1319
01:11:38,250 --> 01:11:40,541
Rasanya aku dengar jantungnya meledak.

1320
01:11:41,375 --> 01:11:42,875
Hore!

1321
01:11:42,958 --> 01:11:45,625
Ya, jantungnya meledak!

1322
