Julie.

1378
01:13:57,750 --> 01:13:59,125
Julie Patchouli.

1379
01:13:59,208 --> 01:14:00,625
Yang benar saja.

1380
01:14:00,708 --> 01:14:01,833
Kondom.

1381
01:14:03,125 --> 01:14:05,500
